<title>TUNISIA: Tunis bourse index little changed in light trade.</title>
<headline>Tunis bourse index little changed in light trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunis Stock Exchange index on Monday closed little changed in light trade, bourse sources said.</p>
<p>The 30-share index eased to 559.42 from 559.76 on Friday.</p>
<p>Volume was 425,534 dinars against 265,757 dinars.</p>
<p>Detergents firm SPCD fell 6.86 dinars to 29.14 dinars. UIB bank slipped 0.24 dinar to 11.3 dinars. BTEI bank eased 0.16 dinar to 21.74 dinars.</p>
<p>($1=one dinar)</p>
</text>
